          "text": "Function and motivation"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Since his wife's death 5 months ago, reports markedly reduced function and motivation; now mostly sits, drinks, and watches TV."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-3",
